        "created_at": "2026-09-24T07:44:42.589Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I built Breaker, a QA/debugging system for n8n workflows, and I’m opening a free pilot for the next 72 hours.</p>\n<p>If you have one reproducible webhook, routing, validation, or field-mapping problem, I’ll:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>reproduce the issue in an isolated copy</li>\n<li>trace the affected path</li>\n<li>fix the issues directly causing that behavior</li>\n<li>rerun the same case plus nearby checks</li>\n<li>run a broader Breaker QA review across the workflow</li>\n<li>send you the corrected workflow and before/after evidence</li>\n</ul>\n<p>No production credentials required.</p>\n<p>I’m reviewing submissions individually, so submitting doesn’t guarantee acceptance.</p>\n<p><strong>Check if your workflow fits:</strong></p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://tally.so/r/VLg8bE\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/original/3X/3/c/3c8cea0c08069797f5eb4cce909fe3c5846b3a80.png\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"C7C7C7\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://tally.so/r/VLg8bE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tally Forms</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/362;\"><img src=\"https://europe1.discourse-cdn.com/n8n/optimized/3X/4/4/440051c4407cee3b852e744cd71c4f2fec77987e_2_690x362.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\" width=\"690\" height=\"362\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://tally.so/r/VLg8bE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Check if my n8n workflow fits</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Made with Tally, the simplest way to create forms.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Free pilot closes: 27/09/2026 10:00 PM IST</p>",
